WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.740
I remember when we had gone to City Park—the swimming pools were not integrated—and we went there to swim.

2
00:00:08.740 --> 00:00:10.660
Once we had gotten there,

3
00:00:10.660 --> 00:00:16.740
the people at the pool that worked there started getting all the whites out of the pool and telling them to leave,

4
00:00:16.740 --> 00:00:22.000
because we were getting ready to go to the back to shower, to come back out and get into the pool.

5
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:26.640
But by that time the police had rushed in, and they escorted us out.
